  "description": "Structural documentation of Ubisoft's AnvilNext 2.0 engine as shipped in Tom Clancy's Ghost Recon Wildlands, produced by interoperability analysis during a native OpenXR VR conversion. Covers the binary layout, data formats, skeletons and rigs, the pose pipeline, cameras, weapons and attachments, rendering, the CRC32 reflection system, method, and verified negatives. Contains no game code and no game data.",
